  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Select one subject which is to be repeated in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none/><mprescripts/><mrow/><mn>5</mn></mmultiscripts></math>&nbsp;ways<br />Select two periods in which the selected subject will be taught in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none/><mprescripts/><mrow/><mn>6</mn></mmultiscripts></math>&nbsp;ways<br />Remaining <math><mn>4</mn></math> subjects will be taught in <math><mn>4</mn></math> periods in <math><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo></math> ways.<br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> Required number of ways <math><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mmultiscripts><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow><mi></mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mmultiscripts></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mrow><mmultiscripts><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow><mi></mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mmultiscripts></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1800</mn></math>",
